  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 30d8a1d14b5d94a45aae97ab03a40993, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 17797189632
    m_Localized: PERFECT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17847521280
    m_Localized: HIGH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17847521281
    m_Localized: MEDIUM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17847521282
    m_Localized: LOW
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17847521283
    m_Localized: ZERO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9763233173504
    m_Localized: Read
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9763237367808
    m_Localized: Accept
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9763237367809
    m_Localized: Reject
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721479
    m_Localized: Hi! This message is a reaction to the article you sent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721480
    m_Localized: I'm an acquaintance of yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721481
    m_Localized: Actually, I don't exist and I have nothing to do with anyone with
      my name that you might know outside the app.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721482
    m_Localized: Good morning! I'm another one of your acquaintances.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721483
    m_Localized: Here we'll tell you what we think of the articles you send us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721484
    m_Localized: For now, let's go back to the main page where you were before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721485
    m_Localized: To do this, I need you to press the button that says "OK" at the
      bottom of this chat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721486
    m_Localized: Try pressing it! (It just appeared)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618628841472
    m_Localized: SOURCE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618674978816
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618674978817
    m_Localized: All experts agree. The 26 dams that were demolished in Valencia
      between 2020 and 2024 are the cause of the disaster that occurred, which caused
      enormous human and material losses. The government has wanted to hide this
      information so that we continue without knowing what's happening around us.
      They should resign for this disgrace they're putting us through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618674978818
    m_Localized: 26 dams were demolished in Valencia between 2020 and 2024 and are
      the cause of the DANA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426683309416448
    m_Localized: FAMILY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426683309416449
    m_Localized: FRIENDS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426683309416450
    m_Localized: NEIGHBORS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 427584111697920
    m_Localized: Have you seen this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335212883968
    m_Localized: I'd already seen it, but thanks anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992832
    m_Localized: Juan had already sent it to me. I think we'll try asking for something,
      to see if it works.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992833
    m_Localized: Nooo, please don't share this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992834
    m_Localized: "This is a scam\u2014please don't fall for it. They just want your
      data. The government doesn't offer grants like this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992835
    m_Localized: Thanks for sharing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992836
    m_Localized: "Thanks! The food in the bar's freezer went bad\u2014this money
      would really help us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960068800512
    m_Localized: You shared a false news story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960140103680
    m_Localized: Didn't you notice how it's written?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960140103681
    m_Localized: You should read the articles before sending them; it can have serious
      consequences.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960140103682
    m_Localized: You shared a true news story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960140103683
    m_Localized: 'You didn''t read it, but you were lucky it was true. Remember:
      you have to read before sharing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815863758848
    m_Localized: Welcome to V.E.R.I.!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815909896192
    m_Localized: Choose your language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815909896193
    m_Localized: This is V.E.R.I.!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090496
    m_Localized: In this game, you'll interact with different pieces of content.
      You can forward them to acquaintances (or not!) and see how they react to what
      you send them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090497
    m_Localized: Go ahead!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090498
    m_Localized: Affected by the blackout? Here we explain how you can receive compensation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090499
    m_Localized: NEW NOTIFICATION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090500
    m_Localized: OPEN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805145240690688
    m_Localized: Your Influence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438567223296
    m_Localized: You've reached the end of the game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438634332160
    m_Localized: Let's review how we can contain disinformation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438634332161
    m_Localized: What have we learned?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438634332162
    m_Localized: Disinformation can come through many channels. It's important to
      learn how to detect it so you don't fall for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526464
    m_Localized: Read the content
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526465
    m_Localized: We should avoid focusing only on the headline, because it can confuse
      us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526466
    m_Localized: Read carefully
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526467
    m_Localized: We have to read the news before sharing it with anyone, because
      we can cause harm to others.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526468
    m_Localized: Check the source
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526469
    m_Localized: It's important to see who wrote the article to know whether we can
      trust the content or not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526470
    m_Localized: Pay attention to the style
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2909438638526471
    m_Localized: It's very important to notice how the content is written. Disinformation
      tends to incite hatred or fails to cite reliable sources.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2919120602107904
    m_Localized: Thanks for playing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2919120602107905
    m_Localized: Press the button to return to the main menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8072467420995584
    m_Localized: Back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9056519614861312
    m_Localized: Understood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9056519644221440
    m_Localized: VERIFY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14472164729610240
    m_Localized: Articles Read
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14472164788330496
    m_Localized: True Shared
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14472164788330497
    m_Localized: False Shared
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758147280896
    m_Localized: Welcome to V.E.R.I.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778368
    m_Localized: Thank you for taking part in our training program for the V.E.R.I.
      team (Expert Watchers of Informational Rigor)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778369
    m_Localized: V.E.R.I. needs you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778370
    m_Localized: Our goal is to train experts to fight disinformation. Your years
      and experience make you the ideal profile to carry out this mission.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778371
    m_Localized: V.E.R.I. teaches you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778372
    m_Localized: We need people who are willing to help others and work for a better
      world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778373
    m_Localized: Let's get started
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778374
    m_Localized: We are in a time of crisis, and we need your help. We live in times
      of division and disagreement, and one of the main factors is disinformation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9858758222778376
    m_Localized: Disinformation spreads like wildfire thanks to new technologies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14487224642363392
    m_Localized: Website
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14487224688500736
    m_Localized: Social Media
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14487224688500737
    m_Localized: Newspapers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14487224688500738
    m_Localized: Blog
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832853528576
    m_Localized: Wow, that's not true. Be careful!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832853528577
    m_Localized: Keep it up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832853528578
    m_Localized: Good job!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832857722880
    m_Localized: Congratulations! You have completed the training.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832857722881
    m_Localized: You have read {0}/{1} articles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832857722882
    m_Localized: You have shared {0} false articles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14489832857722883
    m_Localized: You have shared {0} true articles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645209194496
    m_Localized: It seems manipulative to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137536
    m_Localized: Seems interesting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137537
    m_Localized: Well, I don't know what to think.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137538
    m_Localized: Yes, I understand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137539
    m_Localized: No, repeat it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137540
    m_Localized: It's true.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137541
    m_Localized: It's false.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137542
    m_Localized: FRIENDS group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137543
    m_Localized: FAMILY group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137544
    m_Localized: NEIGHBORS group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14494645251137545
    m_Localized: Next step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736433614848
    m_Localized: Delays in brain development have been detected in children infected
      with COVID-19 during pregnancy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140800
    m_Localized: Five-year-old children who contracted the COVID-19 virus while their
      mothers were pregnant (congenitally) and before the first vaccines of the pandemic
      were administered show a 10 percent increase in cases of delayed cognitive
      development, primarily in the areas of learning and memory. This is the main
      conclusion of groundbreaking research on the effects of the SARS-CoV-2 pandemic
      during pregnancy, led by the CSIC Institute of Neurosciences.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15587561838448640
    m_Localized: Yes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15587561892974592
    m_Localized: No.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15587561892974593
    m_Localized: Do you want to do the tutorial?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19989448721403904
    m_Localized: You skipped a true article. Pay attention!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30210070742183936
    m_Localized: Do you want to share this content with?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30210070788321281
    m_Localized: Keep it up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140801
    m_Localized: Thank goodness your cousin got vaccinated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140802
    m_Localized: Absolutely! You have to be careful with these things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140803
    m_Localized: Thanks for sharing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140804
    m_Localized: I'm glad to see you're sharing this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140805
    m_Localized: It means a lot to me that you're keeping up with what's going on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140806
    m_Localized: Yeah!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140807
    m_Localized: Plus, these vaccine issues are so important.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140808
    m_Localized: "Joe, we\u2019re not out of the pandemic yet..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140809
    m_Localized: It was really serious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140810
    m_Localized: We have to stay on top of all this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14598736488140811
    m_Localized: "Thanks for sharing this news\u2014it\u2019s very important."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341147694239744
    m_Localized: Right Questions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341147752960000
    m_Localized: Don't Share
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36644566015381504
    m_Localized: In order to improve the experience in the future, we store data
      on the use of the video game. We do not store any personal data, only data
      on the use of the game. Do you agree to send this data?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36647627920216064
    m_Localized: 'Increase text size:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 54790439025954816
    m_Localized: GAME PROGRESS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55146829741477888
    m_Localized: Level {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67369464486047744
    m_Localized: Oops... it looks like you didn't pass the level...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67369464515407872
    m_Localized: To move to the next level, you need to correctly identify a few
      more articles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67787236466634752
    m_Localized: Remember to check the level objectives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67787236470829056
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s try again! You can do it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 66697776865882112
    m_Localized: Would you like to hear the level explanation again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67369464515407873
    m_Localized: Topics identified correctly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67405583462313984
    m_Localized: General
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67405583491674112
    m_Localized: Artificial Intelligence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67405583491674113
    m_Localized: Science
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67405583491674114
    m_Localized: Scams
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67405583491674115
    m_Localized: Conspiracies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67489570710278144
    m_Localized: Congratulations! You have completed the level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67489570806747136
    m_Localized: Let's see how you did.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67495532485595136
    m_Localized: Shared with
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67774421647372288
    m_Localized: Fake Articles Identified
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67774421676732416
    m_Localized: 'True '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67774421676732417
    m_Localized: Fake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67774421676732418
    m_Localized: Identify at least
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67775455442644992
    m_Localized: Group
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67775455442644993
    m_Localized: No. of Articles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67775864878018560
    m_Localized: Topic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67812858945482752
    m_Localized: '{0} Articles'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 67955945450950656
    m_Localized: The game will start once it has loaded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76486106008662016
    m_Localized: You should read more articles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76486106121908226
    m_Localized: Be careful what you share! You've amplified disinformation.
    m_Metadata:
